            "review_title": "Review at The Workshop Corner Pub",
            "review_text": "kevinthomas1987\nKochi (Cochin), India3 contributions\n0\nWatch out - fraud during billing!!\nMar 2026 • Couples\nEven though the Corner Pub seemed like a nice place at first - with great music and lively ambience, when it was time to pay our bill, we saw that we were billed for a couple of extra drinks. When we called them out, they put up a show and tried to justify themselves over it. Please be careful - and lesson we learnt - order your drinks as shots separately, and your mixers separately and mix it yourself at your table.\nWritten March 11, 2026",
