            "review_text": "Cristian C\n2 contributions\n0\nWorst drink in Vietnam\nFeb 2025 • Couples\nI went to this bar for a gin and tonic, but unfortunately, the experience was disappointing. The first drink I received had no gin at all—it was just tonic water with ice. After pointing it out to the bartender, they made me another one, but this time, it was barely different. It seemed like they just sprinkled a few drops of gin into the glass. For the price I paid, I expected a proper longdrink not a joke, watered-down version. Definitely not worth it.\n\nP.s overpriced af\nWritten February 17, 2025",
